WEBVTT

00:14:25.999 --> 00:14:30.511
Nowadays, the world we live in --
we affluent, industrialized citizens,

00:14:30.535 --> 00:14:32.512
with perfection the expectation --

00:14:32.536 --> 00:14:34.041
the best you can ever hope for

00:14:34.065 --> 00:14:36.730
is that stuff is as good
as you expect it to be.

00:14:36.754 --> 00:14:38.674
You will never be pleasantly surprised,

00:14:38.698 --> 00:14:40.745
because your expectations,
my expectations,

00:14:40.769 --> 00:14:42.103
have gone through the roof.

00:14:42.127 --> 00:14:45.484
The secret to happiness --
this is what you all came for --

00:14:45.508 --> 00:14:48.057
the secret to happiness is:

00:14:48.081 --> 00:14:50.143
low expectations.

00:14:50.167 --> 00:14:53.412
(Laughter)

00:14:53.436 --> 00:14:54.826
[You'll do]

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.326
(Applause)

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.832
(Laughter)

00:14:59.483 --> 00:15:00.673
I want to say --